# Deep paths (roadmap os-server.md P9; rxlib.DEEP_PATH): every path DOS
# reaches, its 64 characters behind "/b", and the one of 66 beyond DOS's
# reach; and a path of 82 bytes, past the 80 that were PX_PATH_MAX until
# P15 (256 now: tests/posix/files.c, whose paths need no key script).
program: sh
media: B deep
emulators: bochs mame
keys: cd b:/aaaaaaaa/bbbbbbbb/cccccccc/dddddddd/eeeeeeee/ffffffff; pwd\n
keys: cd abcdefg.x; pwd; cd ..; cd abcdefgh.xy; pwd; cd ..\n
keys: ls ./././././abcdefgh.xy && echo fits; ls ./././././././abcdefgh.xy && echo fits\n
---
rx286, test build
/a$ cd b:/aaaaaaaa/bbbbbbbb/cccccccc/dddddddd/eeeeeeee/ffffffff; pwd
/b/aaaaaaaa/bbbbbbbb/cccccccc/dddddddd/eeeeeeee/ffffffff
/b/aaaaaaaa/bbbbbbbb/cccccccc/dddddddd/eeeeeeee/ffffffff$ cd abcdefg.x; pwd; cd ..; cd abcdefgh.xy; pwd; cd ..
/b/aaaaaaaa/bbbbbbbb/cccccccc/dddddddd/eeeeeeee/ffffffff/abcdefg.x
/b/aaaaaaaa/bbbbbbbb/cccccccc/dddddddd/eeeeeeee/ffffffff/abcdefgh.xy
/b/aaaaaaaa/bbbbbbbb/cccccccc/dddddddd/eeeeeeee/ffffffff$ ls ./././././abcdefgh.xy && echo fits; ls ./././././././abcdefgh.xy && echo fits
fits
fits
/b/aaaaaaaa/bbbbbbbb/cccccccc/dddddddd/eeeeeeee/ffffffff$
